  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/gui/title/valoria_logo.png\" alt=\"valoria_logo.png\"></p>\n<h3>前置要求</h3>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tridot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Tridot (Curseforge)-d48526?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftridot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Tridot (Modrinth)-349a46?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Curios (Curseforge)-d48526?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Curios (Modrinth)-349a46?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-GeckoLib (Curseforge)-d48526?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-GeckoLib (Modrinth)-349a46?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&labelColor=FFFFFF\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>在破碎的世界中迷失方向？知识是你对抗腐化的最强武器。查阅官方维基以获取指南、背景故事和生存策略。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252firidark.gitbook.io%252fvaloria-wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/wiki.png\" alt=\"wiki.png\"></a></p>\n<p><em>加入我们的社区，分享你的创作，提供反馈，并抢先了解潜伏在阴影中的新内容。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wWdXpwuPmK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"discord.png\"></a></p>\n<p><em>为了帮助我们投入更多时间到该项目中，并为音乐和音效设计等新资产提供资金，请考虑支持我们。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://patreon.com/IriDark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"patreon.png\"></a></p>\n<h3>我们的赞助者</h3>\n<p>Amanda, Lion1…… 非常感谢你们 &lt;3</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>✦ 关于本模组 ✦</h1>\n<p><strong>一场远古的天灾——“元素崩塌”撕裂了现实。从灰烬中，一个新世界诞生了：一个充满黑暗神话与恐怖废墟的领域。</strong></p>\n<p><em>Valoria</em> 将《我的世界》转变为一部史诗般的黑暗奇幻 RPG 体验。穿越被怪物侵扰的荒凉景观，拼凑出这个陨落世界破碎的历史，并发现希望是否能在余烬中重新点燃。</p>\n<h3>特性</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>⚔️ 史诗级遭遇战：</strong> 面对使用大量武器库的新生物和可怕的Boss。包含大量新的建筑方块和物品，均保持原版友好的美学风格。</li>\n<li><strong>🏰 未知之地：</strong> 探索错综复杂的结构、奇异的生物群系以及一个充满秘密与危险的完全新维度。</li>\n<li><strong>📖 深厚背景故事：</strong> 揭开植根于神话的丰富黑暗奇幻故事线，旨在奖励玩家的探索行为。</li>\n<li><strong>🎵 沉浸式音频：</strong> 体验由 <a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_kTIzlCKrHm_RyFxoZPmnKZNccdCT6XL-c&si=0-No5jkq0tsd3neC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DuUaader</a> 创作的 haunting 原声带。</li>\n<li><strong>🔧 高度可配置：</strong> 模组包开发者拥有完全控制权。移动或隐藏 HUD 元素（<code>valoria-client.toml</code>），自定义 Boss 属性（<code>valoria-common.toml</code>），或切换核心机制如虚无、食物腐烂和法典进度（<code>valoria-server.toml</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>🏛️ 发掘被遗忘的遗迹</h3>\n<p>Valoria 的地貌上散落着独特的、手工打造的建筑，等待你去发现。从摇摇欲坠的废墟到隐藏特定实体的大型收容设施——小心前行，因为致命的陷阱和古老的守护者仍在保护着其中的秘密。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/structure.png\" alt=\"structure.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/fortress_angle.png\" alt=\"fortress_angle.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/forge.png\" alt=\"forge.png\"></p>\n<h3>🌿 在扭曲的植物群系中求生</h3>\n<p>崩塌并未毁灭这个世界，而是改变了它。穿越充满活力的、异星的生物群系，见证自然努力重夺废墟的过程。旧有的植物让位于产生自身光芒的奇异新生命形式。在这永恒的暮色中，发光的植物可能是你唯一的希望灯塔。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/shadeforest.png\" alt=\"shadeforest.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/river.png\" alt=\"river.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/lush.png\" alt=\"lush.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/ecotone.png\" alt=\"ecotone.png\"></p>\n<h3>💀 在灰烬荒地中拾荒</h3>\n<p>穿越整个生态系统的露天坟墓。被骨骼森林萦绕且满是尘土的“荒地”是一片伤痕累累的大地，正缓慢地被一阵无情而悲伤的风侵蚀。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/dread_wood.png\" alt=\"dread_wood.png\"></p>\n<h3>🐺 面对令人恐惧的变异体</h3>\n<p>旧世界的动物界也未幸免。腐化迫使生物适应或灭亡，将幸存者变成了 fiercely territorial（极度领土意识）的猎手。它们在破碎世界的阴影中游荡，对它们而言——你不过是猎物。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/scorpion.png\" alt=\"scorpion.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/corrupted.png\" alt=\"corrupted.png\"></p>\n<h3>🩸 解开天体瘟疫之谜</h3>\n<p>天空本身已经破碎。一颗邪恶的红色行星悬挂在夜空之中，它的注视本身就是对大地的毒药。这颗天体助长了蔓延的“血源性腐化”——一种继续吞噬世界的瘟疫。追随它的踪迹，你将发现被称为“巨兽”的庞大感染残骸。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/monstrosity.png\" alt=\"monstrosity.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/remains.png\" alt=\"remains.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/skull.png\" alt=\"skull.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h3>🛠️ 集成与兼容性</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内置支持：</strong> JADE, JER, JEI, KubeJS, JEED, Enchantment Descriptions, Better Combat, Tetra, Detailed Enchantments, Catalogue, Obscure Tooltips。</li>\n<li><strong>自动生成：</strong> JERM。</li>\n<li><strong>所有兼容：</strong> 自 1.0r 版本起支持。</li>\n<li><strong>Epic Fight：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/valoria-ef-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载插件 (CurseForge)</a></li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Trees (社区插件)：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-valoria\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载插件 (CurseForge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>欢迎在我们的 <a href=\"https://github.com/IriDark/Valoria-Suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上建议模组兼容项。</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>🌐 支持的语言</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_en_us.png\" alt=\"flag_en_us.png\"> <strong>英语</strong></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_ua.png\" alt=\"flag_ua.png\"> <strong>乌克兰语</strong> <em>(进行中)</em> - by IriDark, Foxplane</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_pl.png\" alt=\"flag_pl.png\"> <strong>波兰语</strong> <em>(进行中)</em> - by 𝙆𝘼𝙈𝙀𝙃𝙇𝙇𝙄𝙉𝙆</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_ru.png\" alt=\"flag_ru.png\"> <strong>俄语</strong> - by Ruthenium, TerraPrime, Kerdo, refiq_</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_fr.png\" alt=\"flag_fr.png\"> <strong>法语</strong> <em>(进行中)</em> - by 𝙆𝘼𝙈𝙀𝙃𝙇𝙇𝙄𝙉𝙆</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IriDark/Valoria/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/valoria/textures/banners/flag_cn.png\" alt=\"flag_cn.png\"> <strong>简体中文</strong> - by 蓝龙奈特萨玛 (Azurmardraco BlueDragon)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>没有找到你的语言或想要帮助维护翻译？欢迎<a href=\"https://github.com/IriDark/Valoria/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">贡献并在 GitHub 上提交 PR</a>。</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>📜 鸣谢与贡献者</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AstemirDev</strong> - 代码</li>\n<li><strong>Auriny</strong> - 代码, 测试</li>\n<li><strong>Skoow</strong> - 代码</li>\n<li><strong>Sunday</strong> - 模型</li>\n<li><strong>Kerdo</strong> - 动画, 音效, 创意, 贡献</li>\n<li><strong>LowTransient-34</strong> - 音乐</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>翻译者：</strong> Ruthenium, TerraPrime, 𝙆𝘼𝙈𝙀𝙃𝙇𝙇𝙄𝙉𝙆, 蓝龙奈特萨玛 (Azurmardraco BlueDragon)</p>\n<p><strong>特别感谢与素材来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Pandafolk_Ravio_Li, Rofoo, KoteykaTheCat, GraFik, Wosaj, Rainach, .sweetberries, Feimos, Avacuoss</em></li>\n<li><strong>Calamity Mod Team</strong> - 提供惊人的音效设计灵感和音效素材。</li>\n<li><strong>Tyro.net</strong> - 法典中的太空背景 (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftools.wwwtyro.net%252fspace-3d%252findex.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">来源</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
